    <briefdescription>
<para>An exception class to notify of bad frame number. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is an exception class to be thrown in the case that a frame not in the graph has been attempted to be accessed. The most common reason for this is that the frame is not being published, or a parent frame was not set correctly causing the tree to be broken. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
